/**
 * Config.gs.example — reference only.
 *
 * This application no longer reads a CONFIG object and no longer needs OAuth
 * client credentials. Sign-in uses the Google Workspace session of the signed-in
 * account, which requires the deployment setting:
 *
 *   "webapp": { "executeAs": "USER_DEPLOYING", "access": "DOMAIN" }
 *
 * Deployment-specific identifiers are plain constants in gas/Code.js:
 *
 *   PROGRAMME_SPREADSHEET_ID_ = the PPS programme workbook
 *                               (programme records + USER/ADMIN directory)
 *   PDF_FOLDER_ID_            = Drive folder that receives generated PDFs
 *
 * Do not add a second spreadsheet ID. If a credential ever needs to exist, put
 * it in Apps Script Properties and never in a file that can be pushed or synced.
 */
